1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,520
(Bernadette:)That's how I take it.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,020
(Howard:)This is perfect.

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,960
(Howard:)I hope this moment
never ends.

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,520
(Bernadette:)Me, too.

5
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,100
(Howard:)Well, gotta go.
Oh!

6
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,120
(Bernadette:)Already?
Why don't you stay over?

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,540
(Howard:)I'd love to, but you know

8
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:24,620
(Howard:)my mother needs me in
the morning.

9
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:30,680
(Bernadette:)Please, I think the woman can
manage to put a wig on by herself.

10
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:33,450
(Howard:)It's not just the wig.

11
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,620
(Howard:)It's pinning her hair up,
drawing on her eyebrows.

12
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,180
(Howard:)It's a two-person job.

13
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:42,020
(Bernadette:)It's just, when you leave right
after we make love,

14
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,620
(Bernadette:)it makes me feel...

15
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:44,890
(Bernadette:)cheap.

16
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:46,930
(Howard:)Oh, honey, I'm sorry.

17
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:48,560
(Howard:)What can I do?

18
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,930
(Bernadette:)Stay.

19
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:52,330
(Howard:)Okay.

20
00:00:57,570 --> 00:00:59,870
(Howard:)Like, what, another five,
ten minutes?

21
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:02,410
(Bernadette:)Go home.

